      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Jayden, I saw that you wrote the code related with downgrading scan mode in `ScanManager.java`, and wanted to ask a question about expected behavior when `client.stats \u003d\u003d null`, which is causing a null pointer exception at the moment. \n\nShould downgrade still take place with only `client.stats.setScanDowngrade()` skipped? or should `downgradeScanModeFromMaxDuty()` just return false with no downgrade?",
